# desc: camera & network field kit — arda cams, RTSP streams, subnets, speed (your own/authorized networks)
# termux package | fedora package | what it's for          ("-" = not available there)
nmap            | nmap          | scanner that arda cams uses (also in the hacker pack)
ffmpeg          | ffmpeg-free   | ffprobe — check an RTSP stream: resolution, codec, FPS, bitrate
mpv             | mpv           | watch a camera stream (phone: mpv --vo=tct draws it in the terminal)
ipcalc          | ipcalc        | subnet calculator: ipcalc 192.168.1.0/24
fping           | fping         | ping many hosts at once: fping -g 192.168.1.0/24
speedtest-go    | speedtest-cli | internet speed test (type: speedtest)
iperf3          | iperf3        | real speed between two devices (iperf3 -s on one, -c on the other)
